"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of severe hypertension\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or kidney disease not caused by diabetes or hypertension\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or serum potassium < 3.5 or > 5.1 mEq/L\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or GFR < 40 ml/min/1.73m2 as measured by the MDRD formula\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or serum albumin < 2.0mg/dL\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or history of hypertensive encephalopathy or cerebrovascular accident\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or current diagnosis of heart failure (NYHA Class II-IV)\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or history of myocardial infarction, unstable angina pectoris, coronary bypass surgery, or any PCI during the 6 months prior to Visit 1\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"or second or third degree heart block without a pacemaker\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"OR\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"or concurrent potentially life-threatening arrhythmia or symptomatic arrhythmia\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"or clinically significant valvular heart disease\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"or type 1 diabetes mellitus\"\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"or history of malignancy including leukemia and lymphoma\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or participation in any clinical investigation within 4 weeks prior to dosing or longer if required by local regulation\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or donation or loss of 400 mL or more of blood within 8 weeks prior to dosing\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or significant illness within the two weeks prior to dosing\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"or any surgical or medical condition which might significantly alter the absorption, distribution, metabolism, or excretion of study drugs\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"OR\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"or history of major gastrointestinal tract surgery such as gastrectomy, gastroenterostomy, or bowel resection\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"or currently active or previously active inflammatory bowel disease during the 12 months prior to Visit 1\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"OR\": {\n                                        \"left\": {\n                                          \"raw_text\": \"or currently active gastritis, duodenal or gastric ulcers, or gastrointestinal/rectal bleeding during the 3 months prior to Visit 1\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {\n                                          \"OR\": {\n                                            \"left\": {\n                                              \"raw_text\": \"or evidence of hepatic disease, a history of hepatic encephalopathy, a history of esophageal varices, or a history of portocaval shunt\"\n                                            },\n                                            \"right\": {\n                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                \"left\": {\n                                                  \"raw_text\": \"or history of immunocompromise, including a positive HIV test result\"\n                                                },\n                                                \"right\": {\n                                                  \"OR\": {\n                                                    \"left\": {\n                                                      \"raw_text\": \"or history of a positive Hepatitis B surface antigen (HBsAg) or Hepatitis C test result\"\n                                                    },\n                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                        \"left\": {\n                                                          \"raw_text\": \"or history of drug or alcohol abuse within the 12 months prior to dosing\"\n                                                        },\n                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                          \"OR\": {\n                                                            \"left\": {\n                                                              \"raw_text\": \"or persons directly involved in the execution of this protocol\"\n                                                            },\n                                                            \"right\": {\n                                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                                \"left\": {\n                                                                  \"raw_text\": \"or any condition that in the opinion of the investigator or the Novartis medical monitor would jeopardize the evaluation of efficacy or safety\"\n                                                                },\n                                                                \"right\": {\n                                                                  \"OR\": {\n                                                                    \"left\": {\n                                                                      \"raw_text\": \"or history of noncompliance to medical regimens or unwillingness to comply with the study protocol\"\n                                                                    },\n                                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                                        \"left\": {\n                                                                          \"raw_text\": \"or known or suspected contraindications to the study medications, including history of allergy to Angiotensin converting enzyme (ACE) inhibitors and/or to thiazide diuretics or other sulfonamide derived drug\"\n                                                                        },\n                                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                                          \"OR\": {\n                                                                            \"left\": {\n                                                                              \"raw_text\": \"or any surgical or medical condition, which in the opinion of the investigator, may place the patient at higher risk from his/her participation in the study, or is likely to prevent the patient from complying with the requirements of the study or completing the study\"\n                                                                            },\n                                                                            \"right\": {\n                                                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                                                \"left\": {\n                                                                                  \"raw_text\": \"or use of any prescription drug or over-the-counter (OTC) medication which is prohibited by the protocol\"\n                                                                                },\n                                                                                \"right\": {\n                                                                                  \"OR\": {\n                                                                                    \"left\": {\n                                                                                      \"raw_text\": \"or patients who previously participated in any Aliskiren study\"\n                                                                                    },\n                                                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                                                        \"left\": {\n                                                                                          \"raw_text\": \"or pregnant or nursing woman\"\n                                                                                        },\n                                                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                                                          \"raw_text\": \"or other protocol-defined inclusion/exclusion criteria may apply\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"